l text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Every paid click carries a contract: the ad made a promise, and the landing page must honour it word-for-word, offer-for-offer, tone-for-tone. When that chain breaks, bounce rates spike and conversion data becomes meaningless noise. This checklist lets you audit the chain in under 2 minutes."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-message-match&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free message match audit →"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#pre-launch-checklist","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"View checklist ↓"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"What Message Match Actually Means"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Message match is the measurable degree of continuity between the specific words and offer in your ad and the specific words and offer on the page that ad points to. It is not a vague concept about \"alignment\" - it is a direct comparison of two pieces of copy."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["A visitor who clicked your Google Search ad for"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-medium text-fg","children":"\"free website audit for ecommerce\""}]," arrives with one expectation locked in. If your hero headline reads"," ","$L3",", that expectation is unmet in the first screenful. The visitor sees a different promise from the one they clicked, creating a clear reason to reconsider the page."]}],"$L4"]}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9"]}],"$La"]}]]}],null,"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":"$@c","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Le","isPartial":"$@f","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":"$12"},{"rsc":"$L13","isPartial":"$@14","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@15","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@16"}
