4:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Google describes landing-page experience as one component of Quality Score. A page that does not reflect the ad's topic and offer can create both relevance and conversion problems. Measure the effect in your own account rather than assuming a universal CPC change."}]
5:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Three Message-Match Failure Shapes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Message match breaks in three distinct ways. Each has a different root cause and a different fix."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"1. Keyword Mismatch"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["The ad targets a specific keyword - ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"landing page audit\""}]," - but the page headline uses a category term like ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"conversion optimisation services.\""}]," The visitor searched for a precise thing. The page offers a broad category. Scent is broken. This can occur when broad-match or phrase-match keywords point to a single generic page."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"2. Offer Mismatch"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["The ad promotes a specific, bounded offer - ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"Free 10-point landing page audit\""}]," - but the page leads with a monthly retainer or a vague \"get in touch\" CTA. The visitor expected a free, low-commitment entry point. Instead they face a high-commitment ask. The page asks for more commitment than the ad prepared the visitor to make."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-fg","children":"3. Tone Mismatch"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["The ad copy is direct and problem-aware - ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"Still losing money on Google Ads?\""}]," - but the landing page opens with brand-forward, aspirational copy:"," ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"We help ambitious brands unlock their digital potential.\""}]," The emotional register is incompatible. The ad spoke to pain; the page speaks to aspiration. These are different stages of buyer awareness, and you cannot serve both with one hero."]}]]}]]}]]}]
6:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The 60-Second Audit Method"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Open your top-spending ad in one tab. Open the destination URL in another. Now do three comparisons:"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5 text-xs font-bold text-accent","children":"1"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Headline vs H1."}]," ","Copy the ad headline. Paste it next to the page H1. The core noun phrase - the thing you are offering - must appear in both. Exact match is ideal. Semantic match is acceptable. Generic category language is a failure."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5 text-xs font-bold text-accent","children":"2"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"CTA vs Primary CTA."}]," ","What action did the ad imply? (\"Get your free audit,\" \"See pricing,\" \"Book a demo.\") Does the first above-fold CTA on the page use the same verb and the same offer? If the ad said \"free\" and the page CTA says \"schedule a consultation,\" you have an offer mismatch."]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5 text-xs font-bold text-accent","children":"3"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-fg","children":"Emotional register."}]," ","Read the first two lines of ad copy. Is the tone problem-aware, solution-aware, or brand-aware? Read the hero paragraph of the page. Does it match? A problem-aware ad requires a problem-aware hero - not a vision statement."]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Total time: under 2 minutes. If you fail any comparison, you have a confirmed message match break. Fix the page before spending another dollar on the ad."}]]}]
