ion-aware / brand-aware) is consistent between ad and hero",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The tone register (problem-aware / solution-aware / brand-aware) is consistent between ad and hero"}]]}],["$","li","If the ad references a specific pain point, that pain point appears in the subheadline or first paragraph",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"If the ad references a specific pain point, that pain point appears in the subheadline or first paragraph"}]]}],["$","li","There is no contradictory offer on the same page (e.g., free trial CTA + book-a-call CTA in the hero)",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"There is no contradictory offer on the same page (e.g., free trial CTA + book-a-call CTA in the hero)"}]]}],["$","li","The page H1 would make sense to someone who clicked that specific ad - and only that ad",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded border border-accent/40 bg-accent/5","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"The page H1 would make sense to someone who clicked that specific ad - and only that ad"}]]}]]}]]}]
